======================================================================
CAFFA -- Computer-Aided Fluid Flow Analysis; 
I implemented SST model on CAFFA Version 1.3, June 1997, available in book by Ferziger&Peric.
======================================================================

This version contains Menter's k-omega SST turbulence model with Adaptive Wall
Treatment of Menter&Esch. It is suitable for computation of high-Reynolds-number
flows. (In eddy viscosity formulation I use S instead of $\Omega$, that is an updated version of the model.
Also model coefficients are from the newer (2003) version.
Output files are in Tecplot and VTK file formats.

For a description of the model, see:

1. Papers by Florian Menter 

2. NASA Langley Turbulence modelling resource: http://turbulence.larc.nasa.gov/


